1
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,720
I never knew the Seventh Prince could perform sword dances

2
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:42,640
This is also my first time seeing Third Sister-in-law's graceful movements

3
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,840
That's why I was inspired to partner with Third Sister-in-law

4
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,120
It was a spontaneous expression of emotion

5
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,080
If I've been presumptuous

6
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,080
I beg Third Sister-in-law's forgiveness

7
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:51,840
Not at all

8
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,200
Excellent

9
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:05,600
The Seventh Prince is not only exceptionally handsome

10
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,280
But also remarkably skilled

11
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,240
You've truly impressed me

12
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,000
I've also done some research in martial arts

13
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,600
Shall we have a friendly match?

14
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,760
With pleasure

15
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,520
What exactly is he trying to do?

16
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,360
The honor is mine

17
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,000
After you

18
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,120
Seventh Prince

19
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,120
Your paired sword dance earlier was truly magnificent

20
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,400
Could you teach me?

21
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:40,960
Certainly

22
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,360
He also wants to kill the envoy from Western Yu

23
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,400
Exactly the same goal as mine

24
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:04,520
What's wrong with him?

25
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,520
He's having another Five Minerals Powder addiction episode

26
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:12,560
Seventh Prince

27
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:16,200
Seventh Prince, where do you think you're running to?

28
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,400
Do you still think you can escape?

29
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,240
Seventh Prince

30
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:26,400
Seventh Prince, I've shown you nothing but sincerity

31
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,680
Yet you treat me with such cruelty

32
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,240
Seventh Prince, where can you run to now?

33
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,880
Stop!

34
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:33,400
Who's there?

35
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,800
It was you who conspired with Zhu Huaichen

36
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,560
To invade our Northern Jin borders

37
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,560
Leaving nothing but scorched earth wherever you went

38
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,320
Slaughtering women and children alike

39
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,760
Sparing no surrendering civilians

40
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,080
So it's the Third Prince's consort

41
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:49,920
You're not blind after all

42
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,360
This is probably a secret he doesn't know about

43
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,720
You won't get the chance to tell him

44
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:10,160
Was the Western Envoy really drowned?

45
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,200
Speak!

46
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,080
Chen Lang, don't be angry

47
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:20,680
Right now, finding out the truth is what matters most

48
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,240
Speak!

49
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,280
Last night when I returned to my room

50
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,040
The drug addiction flared up

51
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,440
And I passed out

52
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,440
I didn't know anything

53
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:37,160
The wounds from Father Emperor's beating days ago haven't healed

54
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,440
And last night again...

55
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,160
Now I have no strength left in my body

56
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,480
I only remember that when I was still conscious

57
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,120
He was still alive

58
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:08,560
I refuse to believe he was really that unlucky

59
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:11,680
Got drunk and accidentally fell into water

60
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,280
That's a child's tale

61
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:17,200
Yurou, investigate this

62
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,400
Yes

63
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,440
This is...

64
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,720
The knockout powder

65
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,680
This is the sole pattern from Northern Jin

66
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:24,960
Could it be...
